[ceiling] The two square hook undersides are the current cradle's retention bearings on the frame's 3 mm web. The trial STL is byte-identical to the production cradle. Its current native slice retains two bed-rooted supports outside the pocket, and every emitted support bead has a clear outward removal sweep after the contacts are detached. See ../integration-review/native-slice-reviews/2026-10-03-elbow-cradle-h2c-v2/. Physical retention, support finish and removal effort remain unqualified for the current 3.15 mm hooks.
